# From two till five in Russian: с двух до пяти
subtitle: "Tom gets his hours, a half-hour break and a table for four: с двух до десяти, после семи and между двумя и тремя in Russian."
tags: ["russian","russian numbers","numbers in cases","с до","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/number-cases","grammar/prepositions","phrases/telling-time"]
thumb: "band \"From two till five, in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Although and despite in Russian: хотя, несмотря на","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/119-russian-although.cast"}

